Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.85,0:00:07.22,Italics,Lizel,0,0,0,,Luna, the black witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.71,0:00:10.50,Italics,Lizel,0,0,0,,She was my destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.19,0:00:14.27,Italics,Lizel,0,0,0,,Dearer to me than anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.19,0:00:17.93,Italics,Lizel,0,0,0,,Someone I will never forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.48,0:00:20.84,Italics,Lizel,0,0,0,,My beloved.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.77,0:01:59.07,Default - Top,text,0,0,0,,EPISODE 3: THE CURSED YOUNGLING
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.84,0:02:03.83,Default,Merino,0,0,0,,Luna, somebody washed up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.73,0:02:11.24,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,He looks hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.77,0:02:14.10,Default,Merino,0,0,0,,He's bleeding a whole lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.99,0:02:17.32,Default,Merino,0,0,0,,I wonder what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.32,0:02:19.82,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Maybe he fell off the cliff over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.20,0:02:22.54,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,People do fall sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.83,0:02:27.13,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,But if he did, he might be dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.67,0:02:33.24,Default,Merino,0,0,0,,Oh, look! Somebody stabbed \Nhim with a knife!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.57,0:02:38.53,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Huh? Then you think him falling \Nin the river wasn't an accident?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.08,0:02:41.09,Default,Merino,0,0,0,,But he's still breathing...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.51,0:02:43.19,Default,Merino,0,0,0,,I think he's a boy, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.19,0:02:44.89,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,What are you gonna do, Luna?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.03,0:02:49.17,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Luna?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.34,0:02:53.61,Italics,Lizel,0,0,0,,When she later told me about this day,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.95,0:02:58.63,Italics,Lizel,0,0,0,,the witch said that I looked \Nas beautiful as a doll to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.10,0:03:01.61,Italics,Lizel,0,0,0,,She worried that if she touched me,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.15,0:03:07.27,Italics,Lizel,0,0,0,,her poison might instantly \Nmelt that beauty away
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.90,0:03:14.62,Italics,Lizel,0,0,0,,or turn it inside out and transform \Nit into something else entirely.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.57,0:03:20.38,Italics,Lizel,0,0,0,,She said that when the thought entered \Nher mind, she was unable to move.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.67,0:03:27.27,Italics,Claude,0,0,0,,"Hey! Been a while, yeah?"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.54,0:03:32.38,Italics,Claude,0,0,0,,Hmm. But then what do we talk about?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.16,0:03:38.15,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,"Figured I'd pay that sorry mug \Nof yours a visit for once."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.99,0:03:41.23,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,Nah. That doesn't come off right, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.99,0:03:47.77,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,I need something, I don't know, \Nmore natural? Oh, got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.07,0:03:52.03,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,"You know any mushrooms \Ngood for glossy feathers?"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.73,0:03:54.66,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,Yeah. I'll go with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.17,0:04:02.04,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.00,0:04:04.50,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,What the heck are you guys doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.05,0:04:06.69,Default,Luna/Merino/Minos,0,0,0,,Claude!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.95,0:04:10.76,Default,Merino,0,0,0,,Perfect timing, Claude.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.76,0:04:13.67,Default,Merino,0,0,0,,We need to carry this boy home with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.39,0:04:17.41,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,Wait. Is that...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.94,0:04:23.82,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Kinopio floats in the water \Nand can't stand upright.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.29,0:04:31.50,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Come on, help us! Luna \Ncan't touch him, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.58,0:04:34.12,Italics - Top,Claude,0,0,0,,That face... I'm sure \NI've seen it somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.50,0:04:33.91,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,But we've gotta help him soon, or else!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.58,0:04:39.03,Default,Merino,0,0,0,,If we don't hurry up, he's gonna die.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.09,0:04:45.09,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,Claude!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.58,0:04:50.60,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.95,0:04:53.96,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,Huh? Why do I have to carry him?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.26,0:04:57.97,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,I keep telling you to stay out of trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.97,0:05:01.62,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,I've been meaning to \Ngive something to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.14,0:05:04.79,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,I found some lovely stones in the river.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.62,0:05:06.33,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.19,0:05:14.34,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Luna sure put a lot of \Nwork into finding those.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.65,0:05:21.38,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,Huh? You really think \NI would... fall for...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.01,0:05:23.53,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,a deal like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.36,0:05:36.08,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,Thank you, Claude.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.08,0:05:39.34,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Crows go for glitter like \Ncats go for catnip, see?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.34,0:05:42.30,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,Shaddap, bull! I'll make \Nroast beef out of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.30,0:05:43.65,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Yikes!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.41,0:05:47.65,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,So, what next?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.97,0:05:53.16,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,He's already lost too much blood. I doubt\N there's much you can do for him...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.65,0:05:54.60,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.91,0:05:59.92,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,He's smelled like poison \Never since we found him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.92,0:06:01.05,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,Poison?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.67,0:06:02.53,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.53,0:06:03.92,Default,Merino,0,0,0,,What does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.47,0:06:09.43,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,I'm not sure, but maybe \Nthe knife is laced with poison.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.43,0:06:12.43,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,Anyway, I need to try to take it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.46,0:06:27.69,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,It's a cursed mushroom!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.20,0:06:32.20,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Is that what the knife was cursed with?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.90,0:06:38.99,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,No, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.44,0:06:41.71,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,There's more to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.71,0:06:42.71,Default,Merino/Minos,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.22,0:06:52.22,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,Hey. Luna. What is happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.22,0:07:02.23,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,What the hell is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.64,0:07:06.50,Italics,Luna (M),0,0,0,,It stifles and fouls \Nthe air in an instant,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.23,0:07:09.74,Italics,Luna (M),0,0,0,,like an unspeakable omen.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.62,0:07:14.24,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,I know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.65,0:07:18.75,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,I know what this mushroom really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.29,0:07:22.21,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,Get back!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.12,0:07:27.38,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Luna!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.81,0:07:29.90,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Luna!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.71,0:07:46.40,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,Luna!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.61,0:07:48.74,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,Are you all right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.74,0:07:51.90,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,Don't get too close... to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.05,0:07:54.13,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.90,0:07:59.91,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,That stuff all over you... \Nwhat is it? Miasma?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.30,0:08:02.92,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,Did that thing get...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.19,0:08:08.67,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Luna? Luna!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.51,0:08:37.95,Default,Mushroom Lord,0,0,0,,Well.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.67,0:08:40.83,Default,Mushroom Lord,0,0,0,,Hello, Luna.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.75,0:08:42.87,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.87,0:08:48.84,Default,Mushroom Lord,0,0,0,,Look at you. Did you perhaps absorb \Na poison you cannot contain?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.94,0:08:52.55,Default,Mushroom Lord,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.34,0:08:56.00,Default,Mushroom Lord,0,0,0,,So you have finally encountered
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.00,0:08:59.54,Default,Mushroom Lord,0,0,0,,the one destined to become \NThe End to All Things,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.54,0:09:01.52,Default,Mushroom Lord,0,0,0,,the cursed youngling.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.85,0:09:02.95,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,The cursed youngling!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.09,0:09:09.06,Default,Mushroom Lord,0,0,0,,Step closer, Luna. Leave all of \Nyour overflowing poison with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.78,0:09:16.26,Default,Mushroom Lord,0,0,0,,Even for you, the poison from The End \Nof All Things is too heavy to bear.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.64,0:09:23.17,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,The boy was very beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.65,0:09:28.86,Italics,Luna (M),0,0,0,,I could sense it in the \Nmushroom I drew from him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.70,0:09:31.74,Italics,Luna (M),0,0,0,,It was as if his soul was crystal clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.87,0:09:38.82,Default,Mushroom Lord,0,0,0,,And that may be exactly what makes \Nhim become The End of All Things.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.39,0:09:43.61,Default,Mushroom Lord,0,0,0,,And Luna,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.78,0:09:47.77,Default,Mushroom Lord,0,0,0,,as he is, so are you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.03,0:09:56.53,Default,Mushroom Lord,0,0,0,,Regarding that child, you \Nmay do with him as you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.67,0:10:04.44,Default,Mushroom Lord,0,0,0,,I will remain here, watching over \Nyou both until I wither and decay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.21,0:10:08.14,Default,Merino/Minos,0,0,0,,Luna!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.43,0:10:12.38,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,Damn it. Where the hell is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.43,0:10:13.72,Default - Top,Merino/Minos,0,0,0,,Luna!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.72,0:10:15.51,Default,Merino,0,0,0,,I can't find her anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.51,0:10:17.88,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Do you think she's okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.57,0:10:21.26,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.85,0:10:30.40,Default,Merino/Minos,0,0,0,,Luna!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.94,0:10:35.15,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Luna! Where did you go? \NWe were so worried!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.60,0:10:38.15,Default,Merino,0,0,0,,Oh! All the black stuff is gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.63,0:10:39.74,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.20,0:10:45.66,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Moo! I had to keep Claude company \Nall by myself. It was hard work!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.37,0:10:49.41,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,More like you kept hassling \Nme and wouldn't shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.61,0:10:52.77,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Stop, you brute of a crow!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.77,0:10:57.01,Default - Top,Claude,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, bull?! Keep it up and \Nyou really will be roast beef!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.77,0:10:56.73,Default,Merino,0,0,0,,Claude was watching over the boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.73,0:11:00.43,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,Stop it! Put me down!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.01,0:11:00.43,Default - Top,Claude,0,0,0,,Would you rather be a steak? How about \NI grind you into a juicy hamburger?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.42,0:11:00.43,Overlap,Luna,0,0,0,,Claude.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.69,0:11:02.43,Default - Top,Minos,0,0,0,,Moo!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.32,0:11:02.43,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.33,0:11:06.95,Default,Merino,0,0,0,,He is definitely still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.81,0:11:10.59,Default,Merino,0,0,0,,But something's kind of strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.87,0:11:16.04,Italics,Luna (M),0,0,0,,His body's gotten smaller.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.43,0:11:17.96,Default,Merino,0,0,0,,See? Strange, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.69,0:11:22.16,Default,Merino,0,0,0,,When we found him,\Nhe looked around fifteen.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.16,0:11:24.79,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,And now he looks about six.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.64,0:11:28.53,Default,Merino,0,0,0,,It happened after you took that\N scary mushroom out of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.53,0:11:30.88,Default,Merino,0,0,0,,I'm not sure when.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.88,0:11:36.75,Default,Merino,0,0,0,,Luna, when you pulled the mushroom \Nout, did you use a youth spell on him?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.07,0:11:41.22,Default,Minos,0,0,0,,She didn't have time for that, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.66,0:11:42.49,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.81,0:11:46.19,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,From how he's dressed, I have \Nan idea about where he's from.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.51,0:11:49.18,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,If I'm right, getting involved\N with this kid might—
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.18,0:11:50.18,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,Claude!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.34,0:11:55.27,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,Please, don't tell anybody about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.94,0:11:56.72,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.72,0:11:58.91,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,Or about that mushroom we saw today.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.58,0:12:02.92,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,What are you talking about? \NI can't keep this a secret!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.92,0:12:03.90,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.32,0:12:08.65,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,Out with it, then! You're acting\N strange all of a sudden. What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.92,0:12:12.28,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,The truth is...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.07,0:12:14.58,Default,Flame Magician,0,0,0,,Champignon Witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.65,0:12:19.80,Default,Flame Magician,0,0,0,,Starting immediately,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.80,0:12:23.76,Default,Flame Magician,0,0,0,,we shall commence an emergency meeting \Nof the black witches and wizards
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.26,0:12:29.26,Default,Flame Magician,0,0,0,,to determine your sentence for the grave \Ntransgression you have just committed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.54,0:12:34.02,Default,Flame Magician,0,0,0,,You understand exactly what\N transgression that is, do you not, Luna?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.62,0:12:35.91,Italics,Luna (M),0,0,0,,They found out!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.81,0:12:43.61,Default,Flame Magician,0,0,0,,Due to the fact that you chose now \Nto commit such a serious violation,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.07,0:12:49.12,Default,Flame Magician,0,0,0,,we decided to hold an emergency \Nassembly of the Black Witch Council.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.55,0:12:52.67,Italics,Claude (M),0,0,0,,The Black Witch Council? \NYou've got to be kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.12,0:12:57.36,Italics,Claude (M),0,0,0,,When black witches and wizards need\N to make a very important decision,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.36,0:13:00.63,Italics,Claude (M),0,0,0,,they assemble a handful of top-ranking \Nmembers to hold a meeting like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.63,0:13:04.28,Italics,Claude (M),0,0,0,,But why come after a \Nwitch as minor as Luna?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.30,0:13:07.29,Default,Merino/Minos,0,0,0,,Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.30,0:13:09.15,Default,Flame Magician,0,0,0,,Luna.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.10,0:13:12.64,Default,Flame Magician,0,0,0,,No, Champignon Witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.07,0:13:16.77,Default,Flame Magician,0,0,0,,Surely you must be aware of how \Nseverely the world would be threatened
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.77,0:13:18.53,Default,Flame Magician,0,0,0,,if you were to harbor that being.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.93,0:13:22.34,Default,Flame Magician,0,0,0,,Did you think you would \Nbe able to deceive us?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.14,0:13:26.27,Italics,Claude (M),0,0,0,,Figures. That brat's \Nthe root of all of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.05,0:13:30.37,Italics,Claude (M),0,0,0,,I've seen a portrait of him before.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.01,0:13:34.70,Italics,Claude (M),0,0,0,,In this country, only royalty \Ngets painted portraits.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.75,0:13:40.71,Italics,Claude (M),0,0,0,,Dressed like that, I bet he's high-ranked\N nobility of white witch lineage.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.71,0:13:43.63,Italics,Claude (M),0,0,0,,And most likely heir \Napparent to the throne.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.74,0:13:50.34,Default,Flame Magician,0,0,0,,If you release him to us at once, \Nwe will forgive your treason,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.34,0:13:52.75,Default,Flame Magician,0,0,0,,and overlook it as a mere \Nlapse in judgment.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.53,0:13:57.50,Default,Flame Magician,0,0,0,,The Water Witch is strongly advocating \Nfor that. You should be grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.81,0:14:04.17,Default,Water Witch,0,0,0,,Oh, my. Could you just not, \Nlike, spoil the whole thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.34,0:14:07.09,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.34,0:14:12.90,Default,Water Witch,0,0,0,,Listen to me, Luna.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.71,0:14:19.08,Default,Water Witch,0,0,0,,Anyone can have a lapse in judgment. \NThis may be hard, but you should—
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.49,0:14:24.92,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,I used a mushroom to draw all \Nof the poison out of his body,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.92,0:14:26.98,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,and it's already been neutralized.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.02,0:14:29.75,Default,Water Witch,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.86,0:14:35.22,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,At this point, the boy poses no \Nthreat whatsoever to the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.22,0:14:36.10,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,So, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.03,0:14:39.10,Italics,Claude (M),0,0,0,,Threat to the world?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.59,0:14:40.58,Italics,Claude (M),0,0,0,,Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.10,0:14:42.61,Italics,Claude (M),0,0,0,,Is she saying
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.61,0:14:46.04,Italics,Claude (M),0,0,0,,that she completely neutralized \Nthe poison from that inconceivable,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.04,0:14:48.77,Italics,Claude (M),0,0,0,,heart-stopping monstrosity \Nof a mushroom that quickly?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.11,0:14:53.98,Italics,Claude (M),0,0,0,,I know she's a poison witch, \Nbut is it really that easy to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.59,0:14:59.90,Italics,Claude (M),0,0,0,,And how was he able to carry such \Na terrible poison inside him, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.90,0:15:01.40,Italics,Claude (M),0,0,0,,What's all this mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.03,0:15:04.12,Default,Beast Magician,0,0,0,,For real?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.12,0:15:07.67,Default,Crystal Witch,0,0,0,,I was watching her when she \Nremoved the mushroom, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.34,0:15:10.38,Default,Fiore Magician,0,0,0,,It's already purified?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.38,0:15:12.96,Default,Flame Magician,0,0,0,,Perhaps this is all a desperate lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.96,0:15:16.47,Default,Water Witch,0,0,0,,Oh, wow. You're all so quick to doubt.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.89,0:15:19.98,Default,Water Witch,0,0,0,,It's obvious that you have \Na very low opinion of Luna.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.74,0:15:25.38,Default,Water Witch,0,0,0,,I, on the other hand, have always \Nknown she's a very talented girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.38,0:15:28.53,Default,Crystal Witch,0,0,0,,Wow, your bragging makes me \Nfeel oh so very unenvious.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.07,0:15:34.16,Italics,Claude (M),0,0,0,,Yeah, this council doesn't seem all that \Nformal. Mostly thanks to that fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.23,0:15:38.72,Italics,Claude (M),0,0,0,,But that's beside the point. \NThe black witches' bodies look real,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.72,0:15:41.75,Italics,Claude (M),0,0,0,,but these are all just \Nspiritual projections, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.17,0:15:47.17,Italics,Claude (M),0,0,0,,That skill alone means their magical \Npowers must be through the roof.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.17,0:15:52.52,Italics,Claude (M),0,0,0,,What now, Luna? You're not going to \Nbe able to get out of this easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.61,0:15:57.33,Default,Beast Magician,0,0,0,,I don't care about the bragging, but \Nmaybe you shouldn't go so easy on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.93,0:16:03.30,Default,Water Witch,0,0,0,,Is it wrong to show some mercy when\N she still has her whole future ahead?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.95,0:16:06.68,Default,Water Witch,0,0,0,,You're all going a little too hard on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.37,0:16:10.56,Default,Fiore Magician,0,0,0,,No, you're going too easy.\NAnd you aren't taking this seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.56,0:16:12.74,Default,Water Witch,0,0,0,,What? Yes, I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.74,0:16:15.08,Default,Fiore Magician,0,0,0,,Then what's with that mask?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.08,0:16:17.00,Default - Top,Beast Magician,0,0,0,,You're really gonna go there?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.74,0:16:20.20,Italics,Claude (M),0,0,0,,They wear masks to block white witch \Nmagic so I don't know their faces,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.00,0:16:18.20,Default - Top,Water Witch,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.06,0:16:24.60,Italics,Claude (M),0,0,0,,but my master once told me \Nwho the council members are.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.94,0:16:25.07,Default - Top,Fiore Magician,0,0,0,,What's with your taste?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.07,0:16:28.02,Italics,Claude (M),0,0,0,,I'm assuming that is the Flame Magician.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.07,0:16:26.71,Default - Top,Fiore Magician,0,0,0,,You're messing with us, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.02,0:16:35.72,Default - Top,text,0,0,0,,FLAME MAGICIAN
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.02,0:16:29.79,Default,Fiore Magician,0,0,0,,It's distracting us from business.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.33,0:16:33.95,Default,Flame Magician,0,0,0,,Yes, it is certainly a little \Nirritating to look at.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.58,0:16:36.82,Default,Flame Magician,0,0,0,,Why don't you go back to your old mask?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.82,0:16:40.73,Italics,Claude (M),0,0,0,,The one that's friendly with \NLuna would be the Water Witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.82,0:16:42.48,Default - Top,text,0,0,0,,WATER WITCH
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.03,0:16:41.85,Default - Top,Water Witch,0,0,0,,Really? But I was so proud \Nof what I did with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.73,0:16:42.48,Italics,Claude (M),0,0,0,,And yeah, what the hell is that mask?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.50,0:16:46.18,Italics,Claude (M),0,0,0,,Behind her is most likely \Nthe Beast Magician.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.21,0:16:48.98,Default - Top,text,0,0,0,,BEAST MAGICIAN
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.07,0:16:48.98,Default,Beast Magician,0,0,0,,Hey, Flame. Watch your language.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.44,0:16:53.02,Italics,Claude (M),0,0,0,,That must be the Insect Magician.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.80,0:16:56.99,Default - Top,text,0,0,0,,INSECT MAGICIAN
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.02,0:16:56.62,Italics,Claude (M),0,0,0,,I heard he's a huge guy who always \Nsides with the Beast Magician.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.70,0:17:00.20,Italics,Claude (M),0,0,0,,And that would be the Fiore Magician.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.72,0:17:03.50,Default - Top,text,0,0,0,,FIORE MAGICIAN
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.20,0:17:03.07,Default,Fiore Magician,0,0,0,,But she's never gonna listen unless \Nwe give it to her straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.96,0:17:07.39,Italics,Claude (M),0,0,0,,There's the Crystal Witch \Nand the Eastern Witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.35,0:17:08.00,Default - Top,text,0,0,0,,EASTERN WITCH | CRYSTAL WITCH
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.00,0:17:09.50,Italics,Claude (M),0,0,0,,And finally...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.46,0:17:14.86,Italics,Claude (M),0,0,0,,my own master, the Bird Magician.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.86,0:17:21.89,Default - Top,text,0,0,0,,BIRD MAGICIAN
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.55,0:17:20.42,Default,Bird Magician,0,0,0,,Claude. I assume you showed up \Ntoday just to keep an eye on Luna?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.42,0:17:21.41,Default,Bird Magician,0,0,0,,It is appreciated.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.27,0:17:23.26,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,Master Bird.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.09,0:17:28.54,Italics,Claude (M),0,0,0,,He is clearly the worthy leader \Nof the Witch's Council.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.65,0:17:34.65,Default,Bird Magician,0,0,0,,Would you mind sharing your \Nknowledge of this situation with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.48,0:17:38.45,Default,Flame Magician,0,0,0,,So this crow is, in fact, your familiar?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.72,0:17:43.33,Default,Flame Magician,0,0,0,,You. Does the Champignon \NWitch speak the truth?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.92,0:17:45.67,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.18,0:17:47.92,Italics,Claude (M),0,0,0,,How the hell would I know?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.19,0:17:49.56,Italics,Luna (M),0,0,0,,Claude...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.11,0:17:53.92,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,Tch.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.29,0:18:01.09,Default,Flame Magician,0,0,0,,Regardless, I absolutely cannot \Nallow you to harbor that individual.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.03,0:18:04.93,Italics,Claude (M),0,0,0,,Man, this guy. \NWhy the hell even ask, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.33,0:18:07.44,Default,Flame Magician,0,0,0,,I will give you one last warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.03,0:18:11.78,Default,Flame Magician,0,0,0,,Peacefully release that \Ncursed youngling to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.19,0:18:16.53,Default,Flame Magician,0,0,0,,Refuse, and you will be\N apprehended for treason,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.53,0:18:18.86,Default,Flame Magician,0,0,0,,and sentencing deliberations will begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.49,0:18:23.24,Default,Flame Magician,0,0,0,,He is the seed of The End of All Things.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.24,0:18:26.10,Default,Flame Magician,0,0,0,,It is an ironclad rule that he \Nmust be executed when found.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.21,0:18:32.99,Default,Flame Magician,0,0,0,,If we wait until he grows into The End \Nof All Things, it will be too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.99,0:18:35.71,Default,Flame Magician,0,0,0,,So discard your frivolous sentimentality.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.96,0:18:37.47,Italics,Claude (M),0,0,0,,Did he say cursed youngling?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.47,0:18:39.41,Default,Water Witch,0,0,0,,Luna.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.97,0:18:44.22,Default,Water Witch,0,0,0,,I understand how you feel,\N but you must also understand
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.22,0:18:47.98,Default,Water Witch,0,0,0,,the suffering that The End of All \NThings would unleash upon the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.53,0:18:50.98,Default,Water Witch,0,0,0,,If we are to stave off disaster,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.93,0:18:54.98,Default,Water Witch,0,0,0,,even if this cursed youngling is innocent,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.29,0:19:00.19,Default,Water Witch,0,0,0,,we cannot allow our personal emotional\N distress to dictate our actions.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.99,0:19:03.01,Default,Water Witch,0,0,0,,Please try to understand, Luna.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.70,0:19:06.23,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,Water Witch...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.71,0:19:09.77,Default,Beast Magician,0,0,0,,You picked that moment \Nto change your mask?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.75,0:19:14.77,Italics,Claude (M),0,0,0,,The cursed youngling is the \Nseed of The End of All Things?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.30,0:19:21.88,Italics,Claude (M),0,0,0,,Born from the pollution of this world, \Nit is a diabolically poisonous monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.45,0:19:27.78,Italics,Claude (M),0,0,0,,All the ugliness, terror, \Nand wickedness of this world
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.78,0:19:33.25,Italics,Claude (M),0,0,0,,compressed and concentrated into \Na single, walking, poisonous blob.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.01,0:19:38.16,Italics,Claude (M),0,0,0,,When it makes contact with living \Nbeings, they suffer horrible deaths,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.16,0:19:40.40,Italics,Claude (M),0,0,0,,rotting and dissolving \Nin unimaginable pain,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.40,0:19:46.41,Italics,Claude (M),0,0,0,,and all land in its wake is rendered\N completely barren for years.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.94,0:19:51.21,Italics,Claude (M),0,0,0,,When it first started appearing, \Nhow it got that name,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.21,0:19:54.91,Italics,Claude (M),0,0,0,,and how it's born, nobody \Never seemed to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.87,0:19:59.66,Italics,Claude (M),0,0,0,,It appears with no rhyme or reason \Nbut with nation-crushing force,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.66,0:20:01.95,Italics,Claude (M),0,0,0,,then vanishes as abruptly as it arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.88,0:20:07.14,Italics,Claude (M),0,0,0,,Being attacked and rotting to death may \Nstill be better than the alternative,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.14,0:20:11.57,Italics,Claude (M),0,0,0,,as people have also been absorbed \Ninto it. And with each body it claims,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.57,0:20:13.70,Italics,Claude (M),0,0,0,,The End of All Things grows even larger.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.47,0:20:16.66,Italics,Claude (M),0,0,0,,With no way to escape, \Nnations fell into despair,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.02,0:20:21.99,Italics,Claude (M),0,0,0,,and surrendered to it as they\N would to a natural disaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.47,0:20:27.62,Italics,Claude (M),0,0,0,,The only beings able to purge those \Npoisons from the land and air,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.62,0:20:32.45,Italics,Claude (M),0,0,0,,to shed light on the pollution of this \Nworld and to slay The End of All Things
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.09,0:20:37.26,Italics,Claude (M),0,0,0,,with their own powerful magic, were \Nthose known as the Poison Magicians.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.57,0:20:46.68,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,You said "seed." Does that mean this \Nguy you call the cursed youngling
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.68,0:20:48.61,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,will eventually become \NThe End of All Things?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.61,0:20:49.40,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.40,0:20:53.02,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,You mean The End of All Things \Nactually grows out of a human being?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.02,0:20:54.23,Default,Bird Magician,0,0,0,,Claude.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.23,0:20:57.72,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,I had absolutely no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.99,0:21:02.34,Default,Flame Magician,0,0,0,,It's a well-kept secret \Nknown only to magicians.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.34,0:21:06.53,Default,Bird Magician,0,0,0,,Were it to be made public, it may lead \Nto unnecessary turmoil and confusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.75,0:21:11.66,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,Luna, I swear, don't tell me you already \Nknew this kid was the cursed youngling.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.29,0:21:16.19,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,You knew and you still \Ntalked me into saving him?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.13,0:21:21.08,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,Unbelievable!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.08,0:21:22.55,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,Claude?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.55,0:21:24.31,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,Just hand the kid over!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.92,0:21:30.56,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,If you let him live, he could turn into \NThe End of All Things at any time!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.86,0:21:31.80,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.15,0:21:34.06,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,What the hell were you thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.06,0:21:37.16,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,That's the brood of a monster \Nthat can destroy the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.16,0:21:38.81,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,Why try to protect him?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.81,0:21:39.94,Default,Luna,0,0,0,,You don't...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.93,0:21:43.30,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,They're not gonna let you\N off the hook, either!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.07,0:21:49.20,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,Fine! Screw it! I don't get you at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.11,0:22:01.34,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,You little...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.97,0:22:04.81,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,You're not just gonna hide \Ninside some mushroom fort!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.50,0:22:12.75,Default,Flame Magician,0,0,0,,I see. Perhaps the girl was completely \Nuntrustworthy to begin with.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.75,0:22:15.00,Default,Water Witch,0,0,0,,Oh, I wouldn't say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.00,0:22:16.83,Default,Beast Magician,0,0,0,,Well, we should have known.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.83,0:22:20.30,Default,Beast Magician,0,0,0,,After all, it's not hard\N to understand why
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.30,0:22:22.09,Default,Beast Magician,0,0,0,,she'd refuse to let the boy go.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.90,0:22:24.98,Default,Claude,0,0,0,,Huh? What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.98,0:22:30.28,Default,Flame Magician,0,0,0,,She calls herself the Champignon \NWitch now, but that girl was once
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.70,0:22:32.98,Default,Flame Magician,0,0,0,,a cursed youngling herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.04,0:22:38.17,Default - Top,text,0,0,0,,TRANSLATION: MICHAEL ARNOLD
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.33,0:22:41.42,Default - Top,text,0,0,0,,SUBTITLE TIMING: ANDY ELLIS\NEDITING: ELISABETH CRIST
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.75,0:22:46.13,Default - Top,text,0,0,0,,QUALITY CHECK: GABRIELLA ALABANZA\NTRANSLATION CHECK: MICHELLE TYMON
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.69,0:24:10.25,Default - Top,text,0,0,0,,NEXT TIME: THE BLACK WITCH COUNCIL
